@startuml
' Brasper Platform - Context Map (DDD, Java 21 / Spring Boot 3)

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor<<core>> #E8F5E9
  BackgroundColor<<supporting>> #E3F2FD
  BackgroundColor<<generic>> #F5F5F5
}
set separator none
hide empty members

title Brasper Platform - Context Map

rectangle "iam\n(Usuarios y Roles)" as iam <<generic>>
rectangle "projects\n(Clientes, Proyectos, Avance)" as projects <<core>>
rectangle "billing\n(Facturación y Cobranza)" as billing <<core>>
rectangle "expenses\n(Proveedores y Gastos)" as expenses <<core>>
rectangle "staff\n(Personal y Costos Fijos)" as staff <<supporting>>
rectangle "treasury\n(Bancos, Pagos, Préstamos, Aportes)" as treasury <<core>>
rectangle "accounting\n(Libro Diario, IGV, Activos)" as accounting <<supporting>>
rectangle "reporting\n(Flujo de Caja, EERR, Balance, Rentabilidad)" as reporting <<supporting>>
rectangle "shared\n(Result, Money, Period, TaxBreakdown, GlobalExceptionHandler)" as shared <<generic>>

' Upstream (U) -> Downstream (D) via ACL context facades
projects --> billing : U/D\nProjectsContextFacade
projects --> expenses : U/D\nProjectsContextFacade
projects --> reporting : U/D\nProjectsContextFacade
treasury --> billing : U/D\nTreasuryContextFacade
treasury --> expenses : U/D\nTreasuryContextFacade
treasury --> staff : U/D\nTreasuryContextFacade
treasury --> accounting : U/D\nTreasuryContextFacade
treasury --> reporting : U/D\nTreasuryContextFacade
accounting --> billing : U/D\nAccountingContextFacade (TaxRates)
accounting --> expenses : U/D\nAccountingContextFacade (TaxRates)
accounting --> reporting : U/D\nAccountingContextFacade
billing --> reporting : U/D\nBillingContextFacade
expenses --> reporting : U/D\nExpensesContextFacade
staff --> reporting : U/D\nStaffContextFacade

' Domain events (publisher ..> subscriber)
billing ..> treasury : InvoicePaymentReceivedEvent\nInvoiceIssuedEvent (autodetracción)
billing ..> accounting : InvoiceIssuedEvent\nInvoicePaymentReceivedEvent
expenses ..> treasury : ExpenseRegisteredEvent
expenses ..> accounting : ExpenseRegisteredEvent
staff ..> treasury : FixedCostPaidEvent
staff ..> accounting : FixedCostPaidEvent
treasury ..> expenses : PayablePaidEvent
treasury ..> accounting : LoanDisbursedEvent\nLoanInstallmentPaidEvent\nPayablePaidEvent\nPartnerContributionRegisteredEvent\nFundsTransferredEvent
accounting ..> treasury : TaxReturnPaidEvent
projects ..> accounting : ProjectCompletedEvent

note right of iam
  Transversal: todos los contextos se protegen
  con Spring Security (BearerAuthorizationRequestFilter
  + @PreAuthorize por rol).
end note

note as glossary
  <b>Lenguaje ubicuo (EN -> ES)</b>
  Project = Proyecto (código NNNBR-MES-AAAA)
  ProgressRecord = Avance mensual (%)
  CostEstimate = Estimación de costo
  Invoice / InvoicePayment = Factura / Cobro
  ScheduledCollection = Cobranza programada (venta proyectada)
  Expense / Supplier = Gasto / Proveedor
  FixedCost / FixedCostPayment = Costo fijo / Pago de costo fijo
  BankAccount / CashMovement = Cuenta bancaria / Movimiento de caja
  Payable = Obligación por pagar (pagos pendientes)
  Loan / LoanInstallment = Préstamo / Cuota
  Partner / PartnerContribution = Socio / Aporte (Aportes Ingeniero)
  JournalEntry / LedgerAccount = Asiento contable / Cuenta contable (PCGE)
  TaxReturn = Declaración mensual (IGV + pago a cuenta renta)
  FixedAsset = Activo fijo
  CashFlowWeek = Semana del flujo de caja (Semana 01..05)
  Detraction / Retention = Detracción (12%) / Retención (3%)
end note

note as rules
  <b>Reglas de integración</b>
  - Un contexto NUNCA usa el repositorio JPA de otro:
    consume la fachada (interfaces.acl.*ContextFacade)
    a través de application.internal.outboundservices.acl.
  - Efectos colaterales entre contextos (caja, asientos)
    viajan como eventos de dominio: el agregado los registra
    (AbstractAggregateRoot.registerEvent) y se consumen con
    @TransactionalEventListener(phase = BEFORE_COMMIT):
    misma transacción -> si falla el asiento o el movimiento
    de caja, se revierte todo (consistencia del balance).
  - Referencias entre agregados de distintos contextos
    solo por Id (Long), nunca por @ManyToOne.
end note
@enduml
